===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# A wide [[variety]] of [[Jewish]] and early [[Christian]] [[sect]]s having an interest in [[gnosis]], or divine knowledge and generally holding the belief that there is a god greater than the [[Demiurge]], or the creator of the world.

